{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51008","headline":"芙蓉峯 · 程杰","name":"芙蓉峯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁把芙蓉云外栽，亭亭秀丽四时开。\n清宵皓月峯头挂，宛似佳人对镜台。\n（见康熙十八年闵麟嗣撰《黄山志定本》卷六。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"程杰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}